    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as aspiring botanist, Koru, on her journey to Wilder County to start an apprenticeship with the elusive Dr. Linny.</strong></h2><br>In this detailed hand-drawn world, join Koru and become a member of the Wilder Botanical Society, investigating the local ecology and unraveling the mysteries of its weird and wonderful flora.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/5bfea4c9e0a1f7b8c23180be92fcbb2e.poster.avif?t=1707857509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/5bfea4c9e0a1f7b8c23180be92fcbb2e.webm?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/5bfea4c9e0a1f7b8c23180be92fcbb2e.mp4?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your ticket to Wilder County awaits! Take a trip from the everyday and escape to this lush landscape full of exotic plants and curiosities.</h2><br>From a cycle in the nearby Two-Storm Woods, to a gentle row across the Evernight Lake - there's always something new to enjoy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/d83e304caf916d68f9b0a11ed31b3a41.poster.avif?t=1707857509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/d83e304caf916d68f9b0a11ed31b3a41.webm?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/d83e304caf916d68f9b0a11ed31b3a41.mp4?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Work your way up the ranks of the Wilder Botanical Society as you find and identify more intricate and unique specimens.</h2><br>With a set of tools and a tea-making kit, discover the wonders of the natural world in an atmospheric and relaxing environment.<br><br>Keep an eye out for the papers too - with more successful plant identifications, you may start gaining a reputation in the Science Journals!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/4390978c6e0820f531cef430f542d2c1.poster.avif?t=1707857509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/4390978c6e0820f531cef430f542d2c1.webm?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/4390978c6e0820f531cef430f542d2c1.mp4?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy a heartfelt narrative as Koru enters the next chapter of her life in a new and wild town.</h2><br>Stories are just as abundant as the plants in Wilder County, so you may want to take some time to find out a bit about the mysterious land, or catch up with a local over a cuppa at the Tea Rooms.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/0e49f5305ef3eada9bf0793cab163ed3.poster.avif?t=1707857509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/0e49f5305ef3eada9bf0793cab163ed3.webm?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1741440/extras/0e49f5305ef3eada9bf0793cab163ed3.mp4?t=1707857509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use your botanical knowledge to help others!</h2><br>With an array of plant-based extracts and ointments, keep an eye out for the odd job here and there within the bustling Wilderton.",
